Unknown option: --no-such-option

Usage:
    find-gaps [options] <inputDir>

    Draws the folder tree under <inputDir> with, for each folder, the numbers
    and dates missing from its numbered or dated run, into
    logs/find-gaps/find-gaps-<folder>.tree in the medialib data directory.
Options:
    -h, --help      Print this help page.
    -A, --ai        Let language models help (docs/models.md). Without -A no
                    step asks one; the commands this one starts are handed it.
    -v, --verbose   Also say why each item was handled the way it was, and on a
                    failure print the tool's whole output rather than its last
                    lines.
    -q, --quiet     Print errors only - no progress and no warnings.
    -x, --set <name=value>
                    Override a setting for this run, over the settings file;
                    repeatable. A secret is refused - the settings file is where
                    it goes. The settings page lists the names.

